      "Solomon, R. L., Kamin, L. J., & Wynne, L. C. (1953). Traumatic avoidance learning: The outcomes of several extinction procedures with dogs. Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology, 48, 291-302.",
      "Boulougouris, J. C., & Marks, I. M. (1969). Implosion (flooding): A new treatment for phobias. British Medical Journal, 2, 721-723.",
      "Marks, I. M. (1986). Cure and care of neuroses: Theory and practice of behavioral psychotherapy. Wiley. (Trabajo original publicado en 1981).",
